OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FAround 3000 people a year are
OL,7,     Fkilled or seriously injured
OL,8,     Fbecause of drink driving. In this
OL,9,     Fepisode, officers launch a drink
OL,10,     Fand drug driving crackdown and
OL,11,     Fmake about 200 arrests.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FDamo is involved in a high speed
OL,14,     Fpursuit, but the driver gives him
OL,15,     Fthe slip. The interceptors' eye in
OL,16,     Fthe sky then spots five runners
OL,17,     Ffrom a crash.
