OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FDuring a busy shift in Resus, a
OL,7,     F58-year-old woman arrives by
OL,8,     Fambulance with a dangerously fast
OL,9,     Fheart rate, and a patient comes in
OL,10,     Ffollowing a suspected drug
OL,11,     Foverdose.
OL,12,G0250 Killer on the Run
OL,13,     FIn 2015, Amanda Taylor brutally
OL,14,     Fmurdered her father-in-law and
OL,15,     Ftook a selfie with the body. On
OL,16,     Fthe run and posting online, police
OL,17,     Fraced to stop her before she
OL,18,     Fkilled again.
